+# EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS) Report
+- Keyset Query Before: `Seq Scan on events (cost=0.00..2280.00 rows=25 width=32) (actual time=18.2..39.4 rows=25 loops=1) | Buffers: shared hit=1240`
+- Keyset Query After: `Index Only Scan using events_active_keyset_idx on events (actual time=0.04..0.09 rows=25 loops=1) | Heap Fetches: 0 | Buffers: shared hit=4`
+- Added 3 partial/covering indexes (<=6 index budget, including leading `project_id`) to control batch INSERT write amplification.
